idemiol&#x000f3;gico de las urgencias en un hospital general.Factores implicados en una demanda inadecuada</article-title><source>An Esp Pediatr</source><year>1996</year><volume>44</volume><fpage>121</fpage><lpage>125</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8830569</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R25"><label>25</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sansa P&#x000e9;rez</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Orus Escola</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Juncosa Font</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Barredo Hern&#x000e1;ndez</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Traveria Casanova</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Frecuentaci&#x000f3;n a los servicios de urgencias hospitalarios: motivacionesy caracteristicas de las urgencias pedi&#x000e1;tricas</article-title><source>An Esp Pediatr</source><year>1996</year><volume>44</volume><fpage>97</fpage><lpage>104</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8830588</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R26"><label>26</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Llorente</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Alonso</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Buznego</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Papel de la atenci&#x000f3;n primaria en la frecuentaci&#x000f3;n del servicio de urgencias de un hospital comarcal</article-title><source>Aten Primaria</source><year>1996</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>243</fpage><lpage>247</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8963013</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R27"><label>27</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Escobedo</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Gonz&#x000e1;lez</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name